WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.701
-Welcome back!

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:02.735
I'm talking to

00:00:02.735 --> 00:00:04.837
our pal Billie Eilish
right here!

00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:05.838
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:05.838 --> 00:00:08.374
She's got the number 1 album,

00:00:08.374 --> 00:00:10.342
"Happier Than Ever."

00:00:10.342 --> 00:00:15.314
And, in February, you're going
to go on a sold-out arena tour.

00:00:15.314 --> 00:00:17.183
[ Cheering and applause ]
It's already sold out.

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:19.219
Come on!

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:22.355
You must be excited
to go back out there.

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:24.991
-[Contented sigh]

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:28.761
I have had like six dreams
this week about shows.

00:00:28.761 --> 00:00:30.196
Dead serious.
-Really?

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:33.666
-Yeah.

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:35.034
It's been so long!

00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:37.770
It's going to have been two
and a half years, I guess.

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:39.606
Or two years.
I don't know.

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:44.377
And that's crazy to me,
so I can't wait.

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:46.145
-What songs are you most excited

00:00:46.145 --> 00:00:48.614
to perform off the new album?

00:00:48.614 --> 00:00:52.519
-Ooh. For sure,
"Happier Than Ever" the song.

00:00:52.519 --> 00:00:54.153
-The song you're doing tonight,
"Happier Than Ever," yeah.

00:00:54.153 --> 00:00:56.056
-[ Singsong ]
Yes, I am!

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:59.358
[ Cheering and applause ]
And -- [ Laughs ]

00:00:59.358 --> 00:01:00.627
-See?
Don't you miss?

00:01:00.627 --> 00:01:02.928
I mean, do you miss that?
I mean, you --

00:01:02.928 --> 00:01:04.097
Kind of a performer needs.

00:01:04.097 --> 00:01:06.632
I mean, when we first
had our audience back --

00:01:06.632 --> 00:01:08.100
which, I'm so psyched and happy

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:09.268
that this audience
is back here --

00:01:09.268 --> 00:01:11.938
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:13.072
[ Whistling ]

00:01:13.072 --> 00:01:15.174
...you get emotional,
you get choked up.

00:01:15.174 --> 00:01:17.477
And I know I'm going
to come out and tell these,

00:01:17.477 --> 00:01:19.278
you know, goofy jokes, you know,

00:01:19.278 --> 00:01:22.415
but I really just want to --
I miss them.

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:24.450
I need an audience.

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:26.886
I need my fans.
I need people.

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:28.020
-Yeah, you do.

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:32.492
I mean, it feels
so unsatisfying

00:01:32.492 --> 00:01:34.660
and like unrewarding
without one.

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:36.195
But the thing that you're
doing, now,

00:01:36.195 --> 00:01:39.698
they did at the Hollywood Bowl,
which is gorgeous,

00:01:39.698 --> 00:01:44.471
that comes out September 3rd
on Disney+.

00:01:44.471 --> 00:01:46.172
But you shot this
at the Hollywood Bowl,

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:48.408
an empty Hollywood Bowl,

00:01:48.408 --> 00:01:49.975
-Yeah, in the middle
of the night.
-and did a great job.

00:01:49.975 --> 00:01:51.477
You made it beautiful.

00:01:51.477 --> 00:01:53.412
Who directed?

00:01:53.412 --> 00:01:55.715
-It was Robert Rodriguez...
-Come on. [ Clap ]

00:01:55.715 --> 00:01:56.950
-...the king.

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:59.452
-Come on!
-I know. I know. I know.

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:01.754
It was a crazy week.

00:02:01.754 --> 00:02:06.826
We shot all night long
for four nights

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:08.928
at the empty Hollywood Bowl

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:09.929
-Wow!
-in the middle of the night.

00:02:09.929 --> 00:02:11.897
Like it was crazy.

00:02:11.897 --> 00:02:13.133
It was crazy.

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:16.635
-And you also got
to see yourself animated.

00:02:16.635 --> 00:02:17.770
-[ Singsong ]
Yes!

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:20.673
[ Laughter ]
-That was cool.

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:24.377
Was it weird to see you
as a cartoon?

00:02:24.377 --> 00:02:26.879
-Well, first of all,
they're still working on it

00:02:26.879 --> 00:02:29.548
because animation
is so complicated.

00:02:29.548 --> 00:02:32.451
I'm sure you know.
Like it takes so much.

00:02:32.451 --> 00:02:35.321
It takes so much work
and it takes so long.

00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:39.792
But like when they were
drawing the main girl,

00:02:39.792 --> 00:02:41.060
which is me, right?

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:42.729
-Yep.
-They would send me like,

00:02:42.729 --> 00:02:44.062
"How do you like this
and you like this?"

00:02:44.062 --> 00:02:45.531
And I was just like --

00:02:45.531 --> 00:02:47.600
And it's Disney, you know?

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:50.169
It's not just some random --
like it's literally Disney

00:02:50.169 --> 00:02:52.071
making an animation
version of me.

00:02:52.071 --> 00:02:54.974
-If you're going to do it, yeah,
you might as well do it -- yeah.

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:57.610
But I want to show everyone
you brought a sneak peek

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:59.712
of the concert,
which I appreciate.

00:02:59.712 --> 00:03:02.080
Thank you for bringing this.
Here's a look

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:04.817
at "Happier Than Ever:
a Love Letter to Los Angeles."

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:05.885
Check it out.

00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:13.159
♪♪

00:03:13.159 --> 00:03:18.064
♪♪

00:03:18.064 --> 00:03:19.399
[ Tapping ]
♪♪

00:03:29.008 --> 00:03:30.443
-♪ What would people say ♪

00:03:30.443 --> 00:03:32.211
♪ People say, people say? ♪

00:03:32.211 --> 00:03:34.580
♪ If they listen
through the wall ♪

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:36.515
♪ the wall, the wall? ♪

00:03:36.515 --> 00:03:39.852
[ Cheering and applause ]
-Yeah, that's how you do it!

00:03:39.852 --> 00:03:43.789
Don't mess around Billy Idol
is everyone.

00:03:43.789 --> 00:03:46.959
Her new album,
Happier than Ever is out now.

00:03:46.959 --> 00:03:48.261
Thank you so much
for being here.

